fP5BcvDG4srH33XCibISzfGxRfFR0y0UR9Wf6aQl0b6MqjjYvRA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section><p><span>图1 我校进入全球前1%的13个ESI学科数据</span></p><section><span>本期我校进入全球前1%的</span></section><section><span>13个ESI学科如下：</span></section><section><span>植物学与动物学、化学、农业科学、</span></section><section><span>材料科学、环境科学与生态学、</span></section><section><span>微生物学、生物学与生物化学、</span></section><section><span>工程学、分子生物学与遗传学、</span></section><section><span>免疫学、计算机科学、</span></section><section><span>药理学与毒理学、社会科学总论</span></section><p><span>（依被引次数排序，图1）</span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcibzW7K7ibVbnGGfibFnIvEiaD45hDw7TBJ2svOvSzsywBstrXgum6sG5mm0mWMicEKMA3yIiaUtkmicKzgQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section><section><span>图2 我校ESI学科全球总排名</span></section><section><span>本期全球共8901家机构有ESI学科进入前1%，比上一期（8786家）增加115家。我校在全球机构中总排名为820位，比上一期（829位）上升9位（图2）。本期我校ESI学科共涉及18484篇论文（SCI、SSCI论文），被引总次数为302932次，篇均被引次数为16.39次，高水平论文数270篇。</span></section><section><section><span><strong>再次祝贺！</strong></span></section><section><span><strong>期待下一次突破！</strong></span></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc8fJPwmSRBYeNFIJN8WDicrsh5n3Fff5qO3bpMGllj4Zf8bfibxq9FETR9klu27K9LFTbEugvqibYm9A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>▶ 往期回顾</strong></p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652740901&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=fdb9ae565bd1d95724291d9bd2bc8ea4&amp;chksm=bcd69e3a8ba1172c544dd1eb4fcf3bb24d710e00f3e20981723ee51b2b35853feca5be628b3a&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8Y3oUGILev6p3nIfZvS15qkKemjqVTjk2U4ibtpBQTS